		{"id":"0b67b03f","type":"text","text":"## AB-01 Endpoints CRUD Admin\nRutas protegidas para: GET/PUT /settings, CRUD /professionals, CRUD /services, CRUD /blockers, CRUD /technical-notes/:clienteId","x":900,"y":40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"44233c0d","type":"text","text":"## AB-02 Algoritmo Disponibilidad\nServicio availability.service.js: genera slots de 15min, filtra por horario del profesional, bloqueos activos y citas existentes. Devuelve array de {hora, profesionalId}","x":900,"y":220,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e13cb034","type":"text","text":"## AB-03 Endpoints Citas y Overbooking\nGET /appointments (usuario o admin), POST /appointments (asignación automática), DELETE /appointments/:id (cancelar con validación horasMinimasCancelacion), flag forceOverbook para admin","x":900,"y":400,"width":280,"height":274,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5f7853fd","type":"text","text":"## FC-01 Layout Publico y Home\nComponentes Header, Footer, Layout. PÃ¡gina Home con info del local (consume GET /settings). DiseÃ±o mobile-first responsive.","x":1340,"y":40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"1e2b3725","type":"text","text":"## FC-02 Flujo de Autenticacion\nPÃ¡ginas LoginPage y RegisterPage con formularios validados (Zod). Guardar token en Zustand y localStorage. Componente ProtectedRoute.","x":1340,"y":220,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0634300a","type":"text","text":"## FC-03 Wizard de Reservas\nComponente BookingWizard: Paso 1 (selector servicios), Paso 2 (calendario + slots disponibles consumiendo GET /availability), Paso 3 (confirmar y crear cita). Stepper visual.","x":1340,"y":400,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"58255517","type":"text","text":"## FC-04 Panel Mis Citas\nPÃ¡gina MyAppointments: lista de citas del usuario logueado con estado, fecha y servicio. BotÃ³n cancelar (solo si faltan > horasMinimasCancelacion).","x":1340,"y":580,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bebe0cff","type":"text","text":"## BDD-01 Modelos Mongoose\nCrear esquemas: User, Professional (con horarios por dí­a), Service (con profesionalesCapaces), Appointment, Settings, Blocker, TechnicalNote. Validaciones con Zod.","x":460,"y":40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8e30ee88","type":"text","text":"## BDD-02 Rutas Autenticacion y Middleware\nEndpoints POST /auth/register y /auth/login con JWT 30 dÃ­as. Middlewares: auth.middleware.js (verificar token), admin.middleware.js (verificar rol ADMIN), rateLimiter.middleware.js","x":460,"y":220,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d8ea2880","type":"text","text":"## PA-01 Layout Admin y Dashboard\nLayout con Sidebar (navegaciÃ³n), Header. ProtecciÃ³n de rutas (solo rol ADMIN). Dashboard con resumen: citas de hoy, prÃ³ximas 7 dÃ­as, estadÃ­sticas bÃ¡sicas.","x":1780,"y":40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0cc7dae6","type":"text","text":"## PA-02 Calendario Visual Admin\nIntegraciÃ³n de @fullcalendar/react con vista dÃ­a/semana. Cada profesional como recurso (columna). Slots de 15min. Crear cita manual con overbooking opcional.","x":1780,"y":220,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"638973ce","type":"text","text":"## PA-03 Gestion Visual Entidades\nPÃ¡ginas con DataTable de Shadcn: ServicesPage (CRUD servicios con profesionalesCapaces), ProfessionalsPage (CRUD con horarios por dÃ­a), BlockersPage (vacaciones/cierres), ClientsPage (lista clientes + ficha con TechnicalNotes), SettingsPage (config local).","x":1780,"y":400,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"097de31a","type":"text","text":"## SI-01 Inicializar backend Node/Express\nCrear estructura de carpetas, package.json con dependencias (express, mongoose, cors, dotenv, bcryptjs, jsonwebtoken, zod, express-rate-limit)","x":20,"y":40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"308febfe","type":"text","text":"## SI-02 Configurar MongoDB\nConexión con Mongoose, archivo de configuración db.js, variables de entorno en .env","x":20,"y":220,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c2f6e9a9","type":"text","text":"## SI-03 Inicializar frontend Vite+React\nCrear proyecto con Vite, instalar react-router-dom, axios, date-fns","x":20,"y":400,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a4c53602","type":"text","text":"## SI-04 Configurar Tailwind + Shadcn\nSetup de Tailwind CSS y componentes base de Shadcn UI (Button, Card, Input, Form, Table, Calendar)","x":20,"y":580,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"48e39f24","type":"text","text":"## SI-05 Configurar Zustand + React Query\nSetup de @tanstack/react-query para cache de API y zustand para estado global (auth, UI)","x":20,"y":760,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"4"}
